    "title": "Performance Roofing & Siding Earns Prestigious Master Contractor Title Again, Excelling in Commercial Roofing Excellence",
    "text": "Performance Roofing & Siding has once again earned the title of \"Master Contractor\" from Duro-Last, marking the second year in a row for this recognition. The award highlights the company's skill and commitment in the field of commercial roofing. For many years, Performance Roofing and Siding has been a trusted name as an exterior contractor , known for offering quality workmanship and reliable roofing solutions. Their services, including roof replacement and roof inspections, utilize high-quality materials to ensure durability and customer satisfaction. For more details, visit their company website, where they offer instant roof quotes to help clients plan effectively.\nReceiving the Master Contractor award acknowledges the team's ongoing efforts to uphold high standards and surpass customer expectations. To be eligible for this award a minimum of 50,000 square feet and 5 commercial jobs completed, inspected, graded, and warranted by a Duro-Last Quality Assurance Representative. Owner Joel Boyd expressed appreciation for this recognition, stating, \"We are honored to receive this recognition from Duro-Last once again. Our team is committed to providing exceptional service in the commercial roofing industry, and this award encourages us to continue our endeavors.\"\nDuro-Last awards the Master Contractor title to companies that excel in areas such as professionalism, customer satisfaction, and quality installations. Performance Roofing and Siding has consistently surpassed these criteria by adhering closely to industry standards and focusing on customer care. They have a comprehensive referral program, rewarding clients for spreading the word about their expert services, which include specialized roof repair and solar shingle installation.\nThe company is recognized as a leader among exterior contractors because of its skilled workforce and dedication to continuous training. They aim to deliver value while ensuring that their roofing solutions are durable and effective over time. By providing commercial roofing solutions that stand the test of time, they become an invaluable partner to their clients.\nA significant reason for Performance Roofing & Siding's success in earning this award is its strategic emphasis on customer needs. By listening to clients and customizing services for each project, they make sure that every roofing installation meets specific client requirements. \"We owe this honor to our team and our clients who inspire us to achieve excellence each day,\" Boyd added. \"Every project is an opportunity for us to demonstrate our skills and commitment to quality.\"\nOver the years, Performance Roofing and Siding has established a strong reputation for reliability and excellence in commercial roofing. They have completed many successful projects, all carried out with careful attention to detail and a focus on delivering lasting results. The company balances traditional methods with innovative approaches to ensure they stay up-to-date with industry trends.\nThis recent accolade further solidifies Performance Roofing and Siding's position as a leading entity in the exterior contractor market. By focusing on quality and customer satisfaction, the company continues to uphold the values that have earned them such prestigious recognition. The Duro-Last award represents an important milestone in the company's ongoing journey toward excellence in commercial roofing.\nLooking forward, Performance Roofing and Siding plans to broaden its range of services while maintaining high standards. Their siding services and the use of a siding visualizer tool allow clients to envision their perfect exterior, which is part of their continuous improvement strategy. The recognition gives them the motivation to set new benchmarks in the industry.\nhttps://youtu.be/z0xAmwaQl6w?feature=shared\nAs an exterior contractor, the company's dedication to delivering outstanding roofing services stands out. This award confirms that their mix of expertise, customer focus, and quality performance aligns well with industry standards and client expectations. These core principles will guide Performance Roofing & Siding's future endeavors and strengthen its reputation in commercial roofing for years to come.\n###\nFor more information about Performance Roofing & Siding, contact the company here:\nPerformance Roofing & Siding\nJoel Boyd\n2488056881\njoel@prsemi.net\n33 N Saginaw St\nPontiac, MI 48342",
